    "https://www.hamilton.edu/after/careercenter": {
      "title": "Horowitch Career Center",
      "description": "Horowitch Career Center - Hamilton College 2AAF89FE-DD96-F82A-3AA5A0ED2FDE9576 2BE013DE-1C4A-4A10-AA92407EDA691330 Skip Main Navigation Hamilton Menu ﻿ Search ﻿ Utility Apply Request Visit You are here: Home > Careers & Outcomes > Horowitch Career Center > Horowitch Career Center The liberal arts in practice: empowering students to thrive in any field through career exploration, networking, and skill building. Connect with Your Career Coach Learn how to communicate your value to prospective employers. Meet Career Coaches and Team Career Center Events Check out the upcoming workshops and events offered by the Career Center. View Calendar Handshake Join a Career Community and get access to internships, resources, tools and more. Access Handshake Outcomes Recent graduates are launching careers or taking the next step toward professional degrees. See Where They’re Headed In This Section ﻿ Close ﻿ Navigation About Us Professional Staff Student Staff Resume/Cover Letter Career Communities Arts & Culture Business & Entrepreneurship Communications & Media Education & Social Impact Finance & Consulting Government & Law Health Science, Technology & Analytics Internship/Job Search Job & Internship Listings Interviewing Internship Funding Sadove First Year Internship Program Networking Outcomes For Employers, Alumni & Parents For Parents For Alumni The Maurice Horowitch Career Center is committed to creating a transformative experience for every student, empowering them with best-in-class career resources, individualized support, and a dynamic professional network. Our vision is to provide equitable access for every Hamilton student to services and tools that equip them with the skills, connections, and confidence to excel in their chosen fields. Find your Career Community Our Career Community model connects you to resources, opportunities, and a community of peers and alumni around shared career interests and goals . This integrated, systematic, and accessible industry education approach will guide you through exploration, networking, and skill building within your chosen Career Community. Contact Office / Department Name Maurice Horowitch Career Center Contact Name Front Desk Coordinator Office Location Bristol Center, 3rd Floor Phone 315-859-4346 Email ccadmin@hamilton.edu Hours M – 8:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m. Tu – 8:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m. W – 8:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m. Th – 8:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m. Fr – 8:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m. Social Instagram Career & Internship Stories Students Make Career Connections With Alumni, Parents at NYC Event ﻿ A ‘Know Thyself’ Journey to Columbia Law School ﻿ A Writer's Paradise in Chautauqua ﻿ Dillman ’26 Explores Insurance for Insurers in Summer Internship ﻿ Help us provide an accessible education, offer innovative resources and programs, and foster intellectual exploration. Make a Gift ﻿ 198 College Hill Road, Clinton, NY 13323 315-859-4011 Social Facebook Twitter Instagram Linkedin Youtube TikTok Social Facebook Twitter Instagram Linkedin Youtube Footer My Hamilton Maps & Directions Offices & Services Non-discrimination Accessibility Privacy Jobs Contact Us 198 College Hill Rd, Clinton, NY 13323 315-859-4011 © 2026 Hamilton College. All Rights Reserved. Site Menu Search ﻿ Site About Know Thyself Facts History & Traditions Campus Facilities Our Region Diversity, Equity & Inclusion Sustainability Contact Us Admission & Aid Apply Visit Cost Financial Aid Meet Our Staff Request Information Academics Open Curriculum Areas of Study Our Faculty ALEX: Advise, Learn, Experience Centers & Resources Student Research Global Learning Academic Calendar Campus Life Where to Live Where to Eat What To Do Leadership, Activism, & Service Health & Wellness Careers & Outcomes Career Center Internships Fellowships & Scholarships Outcomes Reports Notable Alumni Secondary A-Z Athletics Diversity & Inclusion Events News Performing Arts & Museum Actions Apply Now Request Info Plan a Visit Take a Virtual Tour Support Give Now My Hamilton Audience Alumni Alumni Home Events Alumni News Hamilton Quad Username/Password Assistance Alumni Council Faculty & Staff My Hamilton Directory Who To Contact Library & IT Current Students My Hamilton Centers & Resources Registrar Forms Dining Hours & Menus Hill Card Library & IT Health & Wellness Parents & Families Parents Home My Hamilton Hill Card Academic Calendar Webcam Campus Map Close ﻿ Site Search What are you looking for? Submit Menu ﻿ Close ﻿"
